// # core/event/ — Generic Publisher/Subscriber
//
// Logline: The event bus. Producers emit named events; consumers
// subscribe a void(*)(void) callback. Used to decouple cross-cutting
//
// Setup: Domain module. Caps and layout are in the parent ANCHOR.oo.
// telemetry (metrics) from the cryptographic and FS subsystems that
// emit them.
//
// Beats:
//   1. event.h — the public API (oo_event_emit, oo_event_subscribe).
//   2. event.c — the subscription list + mutex + emit dispatch.
//
// v3.1.0 file move: app/telemetry/event.{c,h} moved to core/event/.
// The systems audit flagged the prior location as a HIGH-severity
// boundary violation — sec/ depending on app/. Moving to core/ lets
// sec/ subscribe without crossing the app/ boundary.
//
// ──▓▓ core/event ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: cross-cutting primitive, not app ::
